  "name": "Question 5",
  "problem": "A factory is tracking the rate at which plastic pellets are produced. The rate $r(t)$ at which pellets are produced is given by the function\n\n$$\nr(t)=0.4\\sqrt{t},\n$$\n\nwhere $r(t)$ is measured in kilograms per minute, and $t>0$ is the time in minutes.\n\nBetween $t=1$ and $t=10$ minutes, to one decimal place,\n{{field-1}} kilograms were produced.",
